1
00:00:00,431 --> 00:00:02,501
(Sheldon:)You're upset about Emily
and you're Indian.

2
00:00:02,667 --> 00:00:04,477
(Sheldon:)I need to make you chai tea.

3
00:00:05,269 --> 00:00:09,509
(Sheldon:)Now, I have all the ingredients
except cardamom seeds.

4
00:00:10,474 --> 00:00:12,684
(Sheldon:)Do you happen to have any on you?

5
00:00:14,178 --> 00:00:16,178
(Raj:)Sorry, I left them in my turban.

6
00:00:19,283 --> 00:00:21,423
(Sheldon:)Oh, I'll make English breakfast tea.

7
00:00:21,585 --> 00:00:23,865
(Sheldon:)They destroyed your culture.
That's close enough.

8
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:30,195
(Sheldon:)You know, I'm curious,

9
00:00:30,361 --> 00:00:33,101
(Sheldon:)why are you so upset
about seeing Emily with another man?

10
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:36,214
(Raj:)Wouldn't you be upset if you saw
Amy out with someone else?

11
00:00:36,367 --> 00:00:39,717
(Sheldon:)Can't happen. We have an ironclad
relationship agreement

12
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:43,680
(Sheldon:)which precludes her from physical
contact with anyone other than me.

13
00:00:44,542 --> 00:00:46,952
(Raj:)But you don't have sex
with her either.

14
00:00:47,111 --> 00:00:49,521
(Sheldon:)Slick, huh?

15
00:00:51,015 --> 00:00:53,185
(Raj:)To be truthful,
Emily and I haven't dated that long,

16
00:00:53,351 --> 00:00:55,231
(Raj:)and we never agreed
to be exclusive to each other.

17
00:00:55,386 --> 00:00:56,696
(Sheldon:)Have you had intercourse?

18
00:00:56,854 --> 00:00:57,854
(Raj:)No.

19
00:00:58,022 --> 00:01:06,022
(Sheldon:)Well, stick to your guns.
There will be a lot of pressure.

